flowchart LR
    OBS[Acoustic bearing / range / position observations] --> FUSE[ISpatialFusion]
    FUSE --> COORD[SpatialIdentityCoordinator]
    TRACK[SpatialTrack] --> COORD
    COORD --> RESOLVE[ISourceIdentityResolver]
    FP[Acoustic fingerprint] --> RESOLVE
    RESOLVE --> SOURCE[Persistent AcousticSourceId]
    COORD --> OUT[SpatialTrack / TrackedAudioFrame / AcousticEvent]
    SPEECH[Speaker embedding] --> SPEAKER[SpeakerId]
    SPEAKER -. optional evidence .-> SOURCE
